CLASSICAL OVERHEAD — build + decode CPU time per gradient, ms
==============================================================================================
  1024 shots/circuit, 3 repeats, medians. RUN is simulation and is
  NOT a hardware-comparable number; it is shown only for context.

  ===== H2 | M=8 | G=2 =====
  method             circuits     build    decode  CLASSICAL     (run)
  --------------------------------------------------------------------
  parameter-shift          32       1.5       2.3        3.8      39.5
  QLTO                      4     509.3       0.9      510.3      59.9
  -> QLTO classical overhead is 133.78x MORE EXPENSIVE than parameter-shift

  ===== MaxCut N=4 | M=16 | G=1 =====
